  "description": "ASP.NET Core host for a built single-page app: a front end from any bundler (React, Vue, Angular) or a Rask WebAssembly app written in C#. `app.MapRaskSpa()` serves the build output with correct MIME types, cache headers that follow what the build guarantees, precompressed siblings and a SPA fallback that still 404s a missing asset. The build runs the front end's own `npm ci` and `npm run build` and publishes the bundle beside the app; a referenced WebAssembly client is published by the build and served with hot reload under `rask dev`. Depends on nothing else in Rask.",
  "iconFile": "rask-icon.png",
